		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-605593b5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="605593b5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-966d471 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="966d471" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4bfbb803 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4bfbb803" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><span data-metadata="&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiT1NLemRuQzRDTWVNWjBzVnZkQTdHViIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3MTQyMjUxMzEsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;"></span><span data-metadata="&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiT1NLemRuQzRDTWVNWjBzVnZkQTdHViIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjIxNDAwNDkyNTIsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;"></span><span data-buffer="&lt;!--(figma)(/figma)--&gt;"></span>One API - Multi-Asset Access</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3356f103 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3356f103" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>With a single integration, DriveWealth absorbs complexity for partners—handling critical financial infrastructure and providing instant access to equities, fixed income, options, and funds. Our platform manages the entire trade lifecycle, simplifying operations, delivering global scalability and better value than third-party-dependent models.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c9204d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="5c9204d5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="896" height="760" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/One-API-Multi-Asset-Access-1.svg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10657" alt="" />															</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ab0dc3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="4ab0dc3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-77f739c2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="77f739c2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-645657d6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="645657d6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-671f1430 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="671f1430" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="585" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Global-Scale-1-1024x585.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-10659" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Global-Scale-1-1024x585.png 1024w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Global-Scale-1-300x171.png 300w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Global-Scale-1-768x439.png 768w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Global-Scale-1.png 1379w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51bc2a93 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="51bc2a93" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1a4fe712 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1a4fe712" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Global Scale​</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a06324 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4a06324" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The unified infrastructure for global investing. Empower your partners worldwide with a single platform that delivers seamless, secure access to U.S. equities. Built to handle massive volume, DriveWealth ensures every trade is executed with <strong>speed, security, and precision.</strong></p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7cbf54ac e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="7cbf54ac" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-379ed044 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-counter" data-id="379ed044" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="counter.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
