		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-38a4bb8f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="38a4bb8f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-73178e96 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="73178e96" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-50c90c17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="50c90c17" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Local Flexibility</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ff069ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4ff069ce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Launch global products without the global complexity.</strong></p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-243dd593 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="243dd593" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our stack meets international standards, keeping your product aligned with local regulation as you scale. Deploy compliant experiences that feel local to every user.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-373cea00 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="373cea00" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2015d88b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2015d88b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
